•diversion of management’s attention and disruption of ongoing businesses;

•failure to realize expected revenues, gross and operating margins, net income and other returns from acquired businesses;

•requirements imposed by regulators in connection with their transaction review, including post-closing investigations of non-notified transactions, which may include, among other things, divestitures and restrictions on the conduct of our existing business or the acquired business;

